 SSL 解密设备检查自动更新流量。由于该产品已于 2019 年停止支持，建议迁移至替代方案（如 Adobe Flash 替代技术或 HTML5 播放器）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/12842","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1931","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/148999c8327bd04fe7e0fdad6195adf7b36060c6/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1526.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1526","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1526.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/81cdfffcd86317dec05d7dfba407f93d96d91273/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1526.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9a3495eb833b3f1f2096187c4b14884afc98b67a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3fq5-p5h6-7xvf/GHSA-3fq5-p5h6-7xvf.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87972/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1526.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153300_153400.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000573.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1161.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0064","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0064.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0416","title":"Cisco 700系列路由器 Telnet TCP连接拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco 7xx 系列路由器 Telnet 服务存在拒绝服务漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标路由器的 Telnet 端口（默认 23/TCP）建立 TCP 连接，触发路由器系统重新加载，导致设备暂时不可用。该漏洞影响 Cisco 7xx 系列路由器设备，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。受影响的 Cisco 7xx 设备因无法正确处理 Telnet 端口上的 TCP 连接请求，导致设备崩溃重启，造成网络服务中断。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0416"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1999-03-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:21Z","remediation":"建议升级 Cisco 7xx 系列路由器至最新固件版本（如 IOS 11.3(5) 或更高），并在路由器上配置访问控制列表（ACL）限制 Telnet 端口的源 IP 范围，仅允许受信任的管理主机连接。如业务允许，建议禁用 Telnet 服务，改用 SSH 进行远程管理。对于已停产的 7xx 系列设备，建议尽快迁移至受支持的 Cisco 路由器型号。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/j-034.shtml","http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/770/7xxconn-pub.shtml","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19919","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/6e5939e8074723d33adaf5b2f8b0352edab9ba8d/1999/CVE-1999-0416.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e6f80460dd56d97b6079eb72c9467b9a961ce1b/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0416.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0416","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a75ebb477762f54f32c38d85ec939339ec2712e5/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0416.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0416.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e434c1da6464de3012c6c1eff8c0e19ef9669023/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p3w3-x7jr-4c3v/GHSA-p3w3-x7jr-4c3v.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/763b4dfa75aa1890a155aad1b583fdcab8111c49/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0416.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0064.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0062","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0062.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0415","title":"Cisco 7xx系列路由器HTTP服务默认开启漏洞","description":"Cisco 7xx 系列路由器（3.2 至 4.2 版本）的 HTTP 服务器默认开启，远程攻击者无需认证即可通过 HTTP 接口访问路由器管理页面，进而修改路由器配置，造成网络服务中断或流量劫持。该漏洞影响 Cisco 700 系列路由器，攻击者只需知道路由器 IP 地址即可利用，危害较大。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0415"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-03-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:20Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco 7xx 系列路由器 IOS 至 4.2 以上版本，或通过命令行执行 `no http-server` 禁用 HTTP 管理服务，并在访问控制列表中限制仅允许可信管理 IP 访问路由器管理端口。若无法升级，建议在边界防火墙上阻断对路由器 TCP 80 端口的公网访问。Cisco 已在后续版本中将 HTTP 服务默认关闭。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/j-034.shtml","http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/770/7xxconn-pub.shtml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/6e5939e8074723d33adaf5b2f8b0352edab9ba8d/1999/CVE-1999-0415.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f4ffb7bcd93209aa53a757a7ebdf17fe2a18eb33/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0415.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0415","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bcb2bc8aed064ca80cf72b28e99ae813ae48a2c2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0415.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0415.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e434c1da6464de3012c6c1eff8c0e19ef9669023/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gx7p-m72r-4gq2/GHSA-gx7p-m72r-4gq2.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x83000/82498/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/763b4dfa75aa1890a155aad1b583fdcab8111c49/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0415.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0062.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0065","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0065.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0417","title":"Sun Solaris 7.0 procfs 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Sun Solaris 7.0 的 procfs（进程文件系统）存在拒绝服务漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 /proc 文件系统发送特制的请求或操作，触发系统内核崩溃或资源耗尽，导致目标系统不可用。该漏洞影响 Sun Solaris 7.0 版本，需本地用户身份才能利用，攻击复杂度较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0417"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1999-03-09T00:00:00Z","updated":"1999-03-09T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即安装 Sun（现 Oracle）针对 Solaris 7 64-bit 系统发布的 procfs 补丁（Solaris 7 推荐补丁集 106541-xx，含 procfs 修复）。若无法升级系统，可将 /proc 文件系统挂载选项设置为 nosuid 并限制非 root 用户对 /proc 的访问权限，以缓解本地拒绝服务攻击。建议将已 EOL 的 Solaris 7 升级至受支持的 Oracle Solaris 11 或更新版本，从根本上解决此问题。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19326","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e6f80460dd56d97b6079eb72c9467b9a961ce1b/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0417.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0417","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0417.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a75ebb477762f54f32c38d85ec939339ec2712e5/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0417.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e434c1da6464de3012c6c1eff8c0e19ef9669023/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9pc9-mc38-6cmq/GHSA-9pc9-mc38-6cmq.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0417.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153300_153400.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f71e3200-5b60-40de-a215-2cc104f46dcc.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0065.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0065.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0065.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1190","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1190.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1567","title":"Seapine TestTrack 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Seapine Software TestTrack 服务器存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过连接端口 99 后立即断开连接而不发送任何数据，导致 TestTrackWeb.exe 和 ttcgi.exe 进程 CPU 占用率持续升高，造成服务不可用。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程触发，攻击难度低，影响 TestTrack 服务器的正常运行业务。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1567"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-03-08T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:43Z","remediation":"Seapine 官方于 1999 年 3 月 23 日发布修复，升级至 TestTrack Workgroup 1.8 及以上版本即可消除此漏洞。该产品已于 2002 年停维，建议迁移至 TestTrack Pro 或同等替代产品。临时缓解措施：在网络防火墙上阻止对端口 99 (TCP) 的入站访问，仅允许可信来源连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ntbugtraq.com/default.asp?pid=36&sid=1&A2=ind9903&L=NTBUGTRAQ&P=R1215","http://www.ntbugtraq.com/default.asp?pid=36&sid=1&A2=ind9906&L=NTBUGTRAQ&P=R1680","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1948","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4f761f58350f835cb02025d033f6f8c7f536e6b7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1567.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b