le Solaris 11.4 并安装最新安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=92100752221493&w=2","http://www.securiteam.com/exploits/5ZP0O1P35O.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7546","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/256","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/41de94138b7cf6e858138ec4e79e16fbec611fa4/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1371.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1371","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1371.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3012e5f1cf9bcfe839897275a956236aed334269/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1371.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa37ed0317ce1265b487f92916077b9ccbfe3349/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g7p2-5qfp-frgm/GHSA-g7p2-5qfp-frgm.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1371.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153300_153400.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000569.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--65c3b4c0-2b00-477f-9c2f-578367398fde.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1087.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1023","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1023.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1254","title":"Microsoft Windows 95/98/NT 4.0 ICMP重定向消息拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows 95、98 及 NT 4.0 系统在网络栈实现中存在 ICMP 重定向消息处理缺陷，远程攻击者可通过伪造路由器发出的 ICMP 重定向报文，诱使目标系统修改路由表，将网络流量重定向至攻击者控制的路径，从而导致目标系统网络连接中断、通信不可用。该漏洞攻击条件低，无需身份认证即可远程触发，影响范围涵盖 Windows 95/98/NT 4.0 等早期版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1254"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-03-08T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:02Z","remediation":"升级到 Windows 2000 或更高版本，这些旧版系统已停止支持且不再接收安全更新。若无法升级，在注册表 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\Tcpip\\Parameters 中将 EnableICMPRedirect 设为 0（DWORD），禁用 ICMP 重定向功能以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=92099515709467&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1947","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50269681ee58c9b5bf7169b73546eef94697389c/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1254.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1254","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1254.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4631642e37ce9ee8b9057e387df4aee61487fb70/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1254.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-72gc-hjc8-g277/GHSA-72gc-hjc8-g277.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87822/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1254.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153300_153400.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000568.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1023.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0069","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0069.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0418","title":"Sendmail SMTP 服务拒绝服务漏洞","description":"该漏洞存在于 SMTP 服务器（如 Sendmail）中，远程攻击者可在同一连接中发送大量 RCPT TO 命令，耗尽服务器资源导致拒绝服务。攻击无需身份认证，仅需能连接目标 SMTP 端口（通常为 25/TCP）。影响运行 Sendmail 等 SMTP 软件的主机，CVSS 评分 6.4，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0418"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-03-08T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Sendmail 至 8.9.0 或更高版本，该版本引入了连接限制机制。在 sendmail.cf 中设置 MaxRecipientsPerMessage=N（如 100）限制单次 SMTP 连接的 RCPT TO 数量。同时配置 access 文件拒绝来源异常的发件 IP，或在 MTA 层面启用 rate limiting 限制同一来源的并发连接数。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=92100018214316&w=2"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0069.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0057","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0057.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0411","title":"SCO OpenServer Enterprise System 启动脚本符号链接攻击本地提权漏洞","description":"SCO OpenServer Enterprise System 5.0.4p 版本的多个启动脚本（包括 S84rpcinit、S95nis、S85tcp、S89nfs）存在符号链接攻击漏洞。本地攻击者可通过创建恶意符号链接，利用系统启动脚本在处理临时文件时的权限提升缺陷，在脚本以 root 权限执行时覆盖或篡改系统关键文件，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 SCO OpenServer Enterprise System 5.0.4p 及可能的相关版本，需要本地访问权限方能利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0411"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-03-07T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:20Z","remediation":"建议升级至 SCO OpenServer 5.0.5 及以上版本（若厂商已发布补丁）；由于 SCO OpenServer 已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的操作系统。临时缓解措施：修改受影响启动脚本（S84rpcinit、S95nis、S85tcp、S89nfs）中临时文件的创建方式，使用 mktemp 替代直接写入 /tmp 目录，并将脚本文件权限设置为 root 可写（chmod 700），同时定期审计 /tmp 目录中的异常符号链接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0411","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0411"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0057.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0055","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0055.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0410","title":"Sun Solaris cancel 命令本地缓冲区溢出权限提升漏洞","description":"Solaris 操作系统中 cancel 命令存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，该漏洞存在于 Solaris 7.0 及 Solaris 2.6 (i386) 版本中。本地攻击者可通过向 cancel 命令发送特制的输入数据触发缓冲区溢出，成功利用该漏洞可获得 root 权限。由于攻击者需要本地系统访问权限，该漏洞的利用门槛较低，危害等级为高危（CVSS 7.2）。受影响的系统包括 Solaris 7.0 及更早版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0410"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1999-03-05T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:20Z","remediation":"安装 Sun 官方补丁 105401-01 (x86) 或 105400-01 (SPARC)，或升级至 Solaris 8 及以上版本。临时缓解措施：移除 cancel 命令的 setuid root 权限 (chmod 755 /usr/bin/cancel)，或限制受信用户访问该命令。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/293","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19234","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e6f80460dd56d97b6079eb72c9467b9a961ce1b/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0410.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0410","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0410.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a75ebb477762f54f32c38d85ec939339ec2712e5/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0410.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e434c1da6464de3012c6c1eff8c0e19ef9669023/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r9mp-gf5j-985f/GHSA-r9mp-gf5j-985f.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0410.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d0c16ada-3ed0-423a-99c8-dc346abdf212.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0055.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1025","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1025.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1256","title":"Oracle Database Assistant 密码明文存储漏洞","description":"Oracle Database Assistant 1.0（Oracle 8.0.3 Enterprise Edition 附带组件）在创建新数据库时，将数据库主密码以明文形式写入 spoolmain.log 日志文件中，导致本地攻击者可通过读取该日志文件获取数据库管理员密码。该漏洞源于程序未对敏感凭据进行安全处理，攻击者只需拥有本地文件读取权限即可利用，进而获得数据库完全控制权限。CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1256"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-03-04T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:03Z","remediation":"升级 Oracle 数据库至受支持的版本（如 19c 或 21c），该漏洞已在后续版本修复。若无法升级，限制 spoolmain.log 文件权限为仅数据库管理员可读写（chmod 600），并在每次创建数据库后立即删除该日志文件中的明文密码记录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=92056752115116&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/12744","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1902","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50269681ee58c9b5bf7169b73546eef94697389c/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1256.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1256","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1256.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4631642e37ce9ee8b9057e387df4aee61487fb70/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1256.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gfhx-4m9p-4j98/GHSA-gfhx-4m9p-4j98.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87815/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1256.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153300_153400.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000564.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1025.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0054","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0054.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0409","title":"SuSE Linux gnuplot 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"S.u.S.E Linux 5.2 系统中 gnuplot 程序存在本地缓冲区溢出漏洞。由于 gnuplot 在处理特定输入时未对数据长度进行充分检查，导致本地用户可通过向程序提交特制超长参数触发缓冲区溢出，从而覆盖内存中的关键数据，实现权限提升获取 root 权限。攻击者需具有本地系统访问权限，无法远程利用。该漏洞影响 S.u.S.E Linux 5.2 等早期 Linux 发行版。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0409"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1999-03-04T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:20Z","remediation":"立即执行 `chmod -s /usr/bin/gnuplot` 移除 gnuplot 的 suid root 权限位，这是最直接有效的缓解措施。同时将 gnuplot 升级至 3.7 及以上版本，该版本已修复 plot.c 中 HOME 环境变量的栈缓冲区溢出漏洞。如使用 S.u.S.E 系统，可将 `/etc/rc.config` 中 `PERMISSION_SECURITY` 设为 `\"paranoid\"` 以自动管理 suid 权限。作为深度防御，建议限制普通用户对 svgalib 和 /dev/mem 的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/319","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19254","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f4ffb7bcd93209aa53a757a7ebdf17fe2a18eb33/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0409.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0409","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0409.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a75ebb477762f54f32c38d85ec939339ec2712e5/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0409.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e434c1da6464de3012c6c1eff8c0e19ef9669023/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g722-hhhg-4rh7/GHSA-g722-hhhg-4rh7.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0409.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt","https://github.com/zephyros1603/RadiantProcessors/blob/7d44cb1cd4b9e088fbe463f1b19be50a04c2efe8/Backend/RAG/data/allitems.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0054.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1179","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1179.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1551","title":"Ipswitch IMail Web服务缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Ipswitch IMail 5.0及6.0版本的Web服务组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送超长URL触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务崩溃拒绝服务，在特定条件下可能实现任意代码执行。该漏洞利用方式简单，无需身份认证，影响运行Ipswitch IMail的邮件服务器系统。厂商已提供安全更新建议升级至高版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1551"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-03-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:41Z","remediation":"将 Ipswitch IMail 升级至 6.1 或更高版本，该版本修复了 Web 服务 (端口 8383) 中处理长 URL 时的缓冲区溢出问题。如无法升级，可在防火墙上限制对 8383 端口的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接，作为临时缓解措施。由于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的邮件服务器（如 Exchange 或 MOVEit）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=92038879607336&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/505","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1898","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19380","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cb31df1745cb795b327f3818ad29a4b3cf1cd125/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1551.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1551","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1551.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be827cc2d99405b0a015aad2694b62cec4eb4f9e/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1551.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/26d7afd7aa97d50454756aec5636fa553464ffd2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6294-xqxp-m342/GHSA-6294-xqxp-m342.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153300_153400.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1551.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000563.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3a6d1c44-2d87-482f-a12e-58ec64cc3585.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1179.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1179.toml"],"has_poc":true